<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '48px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>冷冷与清清，能不能换</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>环节二 · 任务一</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 110, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 28 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34' }}>寻寻（不信）→ 觅觅（细察）→ 确认“真个去矣”</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 110, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.09)', justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 28 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>冷冷（外）　→　清清（内）</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 110, background: 'rgba(180,85,45,0.12)', justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 28 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#B4552D' }}>凄凄 → 惨惨 → 戚戚：凝于心 → 不堪任 → 肠痛心碎</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>把“冷冷”挪到“清清”下面：由外入内这一层就断了。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《声声慢》· 李清照</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>07/16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>